157
00:09:38,470 --> 00:09:39,500
Yeah, I know, Frank.
是，我知道，弗蘭克。

158
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:42,970
I counted them when they were coming out of my area.
我生他們的時候數過了。

159
00:09:44,650 --> 00:09:47,340
Sometimes, I think that..
有時候我甚至想……

160
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:52,150
Oh, no, no, no, I can't say it. It's too horrible. No.
哦，不，不，不，我不能說， 太可怕了。不。

161
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:54,990
What?
什麼？

162
00:09:55,190 --> 00:09:57,320
No, no, I can't.
不，我不能。

163
00:09:59,490 --> 00:10:02,090
Oh, my God, Frank. Are you thinking of leaving?
噢，天吶，弗蘭克，你想擺脫他們？

164
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:05,430
Because I didn't have those triplets so you could run out on them.
那三胞胎不算是我的 所以你就想要拋棄他們！

165
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:08,930
Oh, no, I would never do that. No. I just..
噢，不！我永遠不會那麼做。不。

166
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:13,730
was thinking that, you know, maybe you could take one.
我只是想，你知道嗎 也許你可以帶走一個。

167
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:15,600
What?
什麼？！  

168
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:20,110
You can't separate them, that's terrible! Which one?
你不能把它們分開！這太可怕了。 哪一個？

169
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,640
Thank you so much for seeing us.
謝謝你能讓我們來。

170
00:10:26,820 --> 00:10:29,020
Phoebe has told us great things about you guys.
菲比跟我們說過你們做的好事了。

171
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:30,820
Please, we're happy to help.
噢，請進，我們很願意幫忙。

172
00:10:31,130 --> 00:10:33,620
We went through the same thing when we were adopting.
我們領養的時候也經歷過這種事

173
00:10:33,790 --> 00:10:37,890
So a lot of malfunctioning wee-wees and hoo-hoos in this room, huh?
那麼，這間屋子裡也充斥著 wee-wee和hoo-hoo的故障聲了，呃？

174
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:46,530
I mean, you have a lovely home.
我是說，你們過得很開心。

175
00:10:47,110 --> 00:10:49,010
We appreciate anything you can tell us.
好吧，你們說的一切我們都很感激。

176
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:52,630
Well, actually, I think this might help.
當然，實際上，我想會有幫助的。

177
00:10:52,850 --> 00:10:53,870
It's pretty much..
這些大概就是

178
00:10:54,050 --> 00:10:56,210
- all the information you need. - Oh, my God.
-你們所需要的所有信息了。 -噢，天吶！

179
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:59,220
Everything is broken into categories, then cross-referenced.
所有的東西都按類別分開 可以互相引用

180
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:02,220
Then color-coded to correspond with the forms in the back.
還根據背面的顏色進行了標注。

181
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:03,520
Thank you.
太感謝了。

182
00:11:03,890 --> 00:11:06,020
I think I just had a tiny orgasm.
我想我剛經歷了一次小高潮。

183
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:13,670
I know the process is frustrating, but it's so worth it.
我知道過程是讓人沮喪的 不過是值得的。

184
00:11:13,830 --> 00:11:16,890
Adopting Owen was the best thing that ever happened to us.
領養歐文是我們經歷過得最好的事情。

185
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:19,330
That's great. Can I see the book?
太棒了。我能看看這本書嗎？

186
00:11:20,540 --> 00:11:23,600
You want me to wash my hands first, don't you?
你想讓我先洗手，是不是？

187
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:26,840
Please. It's just so pretty and white.
這……這個這麼漂亮，而且是白的。

188
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:30,180
Bathroom is down the hall to your left.
洗手間在走廊那頭，左邊。

189
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:32,950
I would have told him to do it too.
我也讓他這麼做過。

190
00:11:33,190 --> 00:11:35,250
Can I adopt you?
我能領養你嗎?

191
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,720
- Hey, you must be Owen. - Yeah.
-嗨，你一定是歐文。 -對。

192
00:11:39,930 --> 00:11:42,450
I'm Chandler. Hey, I was in the Scouts too.
我叫錢德。嗨，我也當過童子軍。

193
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:46,230
- You were? - In fact, my father was a den mother.
-真的？ -當然，實際上我爸爸是童子軍的女訓導員。

194
00:11:48,070 --> 00:11:49,900
You know how to use a compass?
你知道怎麼用指南針嗎？

195
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:51,640
I have a badge in it.
我得過一枚徽章。

196
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:54,070
- You do? That's fantastic. - You want to see it?
-真的？真是太棒了！ -你想看嗎？

197
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:56,640
I'd love to, but I gotta get back to your parents.
當然想，不過我得先回去跟你的父母聊聊。

198
00:11:56,810 --> 00:11:59,110
They're telling us about how they adopted you.
他們在告訴我們怎麼領養你的事。

199
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,910
What?
什麼？！？

200
00:12:06,950 --> 00:12:08,720
What?
怎麼了？

201
00:12:09,590 --> 00:12:12,150
I'm adopted?
我是領養的？

202
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:15,450
I got nothing.
我什麼都不知道。

203
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,860
I'm adopted?
我是領養的？

204
00:12:22,170 --> 00:12:24,140
No.
不

205
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:27,230
I didn't say that. I said..
我沒那麼說. 我是說..

206
00:12:27,410 --> 00:12:29,740
you're a doctor.
你是個醫生.

207
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:32,500
A doctor.
一個醫生.

208
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:37,050
Hey, doctor, my arm hurts. Can you fix it for me?
嗨, 大夫，我的胳膊疼. 你能幫我修理一下嗎?

209
00:12:38,090 --> 00:12:40,680
I can't believe I'm adopted.
我真不敢相信我是領養的.

210
00:12:40,860 --> 00:12:43,880
So you're not gonna fix my arm?
那..你不準備修理我的胳膊了?

211
00:12:49,230 --> 00:12:53,390
Well, that first batch of margaritas was not so great..
第一批馬格麗塔不是太好

212
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:57,000
but this second batch is good.
可第二批實在太棒..棒了。

213
00:12:58,710 --> 00:13:02,040
Well, maybe the next batch, we could all get some.
好吧，希望到下一批的時候 我們都能喝一點。

214
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:04,610
Oh, God, this is fun, isn't it?
噢，夥計們，這很有趣，是嗎？

215
00:13:04,780 --> 00:13:07,040
You know, just the four of us.
知道嗎？就我們四個。

216
00:13:07,210 --> 00:13:09,050
Just hanging.
就這麼呆著。

217
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:11,180
Dude, are you okay?
夥計，你還好吧？

218
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:13,290
And when are the fajitas gonna be ready?
法加它什麼時候才能好？

219
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:17,810
I'm fine, okay? I'm great.
我很好！嘿，我很棒！

220
00:13:17,990 --> 00:13:20,960
I'm just.. I'm just proud of us.
我只是…… 我只是為我們而驕傲。

221
00:13:21,130 --> 00:13:24,560
You know? There's no weirdness, no tension.
一點都不古怪，一點都不緊張。

222
00:13:24,770 --> 00:13:26,760
No awareness.
一點都不清醒。

223
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,870
We make a great foursome. We should do more stuff together.
我們組成一個「四人組」。 我們應該一塊再做些什麼。

224
00:13:31,810 --> 00:13:33,740
Let's take a trip!
哦！ 我們去旅行吧！

225
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,240
We could all go on your boat.
我們可以坐你的船去.

226
00:13:37,410 --> 00:13:40,210
Joey has this amazing sailboat.
喬伊有一艘很棒的帆船.

227
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:42,710
Actually, Ross, I sold the boat two years ago.
實際上, 羅斯 我兩年前我已經把船賣掉了.

228
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,980
Oh, no. Idiot!
哦, 不. 白癡!

229
00:13:46,790 --> 00:13:48,690
Well, yeah, but I could get another one.
呃, 是的, 不過我可以弄來另外一個.

230
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:51,450
- This trip sounds great. - Yeah?
- 這個旅行聽起來棒極了. - 是嗎?

231
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:54,320
Okay, where do you think we can go?
好, 你覺得我們能去哪?

232
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:56,730
My fajitas!
我的法加它!!

233
00:13:59,470 --> 00:14:02,590
Look, Charlie, I just want you to know..
聽著，查莉，我只想讓你知道。

234
00:14:02,770 --> 00:14:06,870
Ross is just having a little trouble adjusting to the thought of Joey and me.
羅斯還需要時間習慣我跟喬伊在一起。

235
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:09,270
You know, he normally doesn't drink like this.
知道麼，他一般不這麼喝酒的。

236
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:12,740
You know what, this is nothing. My father is a raging alcoholic.
噢，你知道嗎？這沒什麼。 我爸爸就是個瘋狂的酒鬼。

237
00:14:16,450 --> 00:14:19,110
I'm sorry, have I made this evening uncomfortable?
噢，對不起 讓你們不舒服了？

238
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:25,690
Fajitas! Be careful! Very hot plate! Very hot!
法加它!  當心，盤子很燙，盤子很燙！！

239
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:27,850
Ross, you don't even have oven mitts on.
羅斯，你怎麼沒戴手套！

240
00:14:31,430 --> 00:14:34,200
That is gonna hurt tomorrow.
明天手要疼了！

241
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,690
Okay, well, this is crazy.
好吧，好吧，這太瘋狂了。

242
00:14:38,910 --> 00:14:42,400
We can't seriously be talking about me taking one of your kids, can we?
我們不可能是在嚴肅的討論 我要帶走一個孩子，是嗎？

243
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,130
Oh, no, of course we're not.
不，當然不是。

244
00:14:44,310 --> 00:14:45,970
- That's insane. - I know.
- 太愚蠢了。 - 我知道。

245
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:47,610
Alice would never go for it.
愛麗絲不會支持的，是嗎？

246
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:51,050
She's pretty tired too. I think we could get her on board.
噢，我不知道，她也太累了。 我想她可能會入伙的。

247
00:14:52,650 --> 00:14:57,090
Well, just for argument's sake, you know, hypothetically..
好吧，知道嗎，只是為了爭論， 知道嗎，是假設的。

248
00:14:57,260 --> 00:14:59,350
which one would you be willing to give up?
你要放棄哪一個？

249
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:02,950
Frank Jr. Jr.?
小小弗蘭克?

250
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:05,360
Well, it'd be great for my shoulder.
噢，你選了這麼好的一個。

251
00:15:05,530 --> 00:15:07,190
You'd be getting a really good one.
噢，你選了這麼好的一個。

252
00:15:07,370 --> 00:15:08,670
He's really funny.
我是說，知道嗎，他真是太有趣了。

253
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:11,100
Like, the other day, he made up this joke:
比如，那天他說了個笑話

254
00:15:11,270 --> 00:15:13,930
What's green and says, "Hey, I'm a frog"?
什麼東西是綠的並且說 「嗨，我是一隻青蛙」？

255
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:17,500
A talking frog.
一隻會說話的青蛙！

256
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:22,950
Oh, no, you can't have him, he's too funny.
噢，不，你不能帶他走。他太有意思了。

257
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:26,650
Well, all right, that's fine. What about Leslie?
好吧，好吧，沒問題。那萊絲莉呢？

258
00:15:26,850 --> 00:15:28,980
Oh, no, no, not Leslie. No.
噢，不，不。不要是萊絲莉。

259
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:32,850
She's the only one that knows how to burp the alphabet.
不，她……她是唯一一個會 打著嗝說出字母表來的。

260
00:15:34,190 --> 00:15:35,890
All right, so that leaves Chandler.
好吧，那就剩下錢德了。

261
00:15:36,130 --> 00:15:39,330
No, no, you can't have Chandler. No, no. She's my little genius.
噢，不，不，你不能帶走錢德 不。不，不。她是個小天才。

262
00:15:39,530 --> 00:15:41,000
I got big hopes for her.
我對她抱有很大期望。

263
00:15:41,170 --> 00:15:44,900
She's gonna be a doctor or a realtor.
她會成為醫生或者房地產經紀人……

264
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:51,410
Wow, Frank, I think we just ran out of kids.
哇，弗蘭克。我想我誰都帶不走了。

265
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,670
Oh, I think you're right.
噢，我想你是對的。

266
00:15:57,650 --> 00:16:02,320
Oh, wow. Phoebe, I don't think I can give one of them up.
哦，哇，菲比 我不認為我能放棄任何一個。

267
00:16:02,490 --> 00:16:06,220
I mean, you know, they drive me crazy, but they're my babies.
我是說，知道嗎 他們讓我發瘋，可他們是我的孩子。

268
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:12,030
I'm sorry, Frank, I didn't realize things were so bad.
很抱歉，弗蘭克。我沒想到事情會這樣。

269
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:15,430
You know, I'll help out more. I can baby-sit anytime you want.
知道嗎，我會幫你的。 你需要的時候我可以照顧他們。

270
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:17,260
You name the day and I'll be there.
你說一天，我會去的。

271
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:19,840
- How about tomorrow? - Well, that's not good.
-明天怎麼樣？ -呃，不好。

272
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:23,940
But I can move some stuff around and I'll be there.
不過知道嗎，我會推掉其它事 我會到的。

273
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:26,310
You and Alice just take the whole day together.
你和愛麗絲可以整天呆在一起。

274
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:28,510
You'd do that for us?
你為我們這麼做？

275
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,950
Are you kidding? That's what sisters are for.
你開玩笑嗎？你以為姐姐是幹什麼的？

276
00:16:36,990 --> 00:16:39,360
Oh, look at them.
看看他們！ 

277
00:16:40,430 --> 00:16:43,260
I love you so much.
噢，我真愛你們。

278
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,060
Oh, crap, don't wake up! Don't wake up!
噢，天吶，別醒過來，別醒過來！

279
00:16:49,970 --> 00:16:53,100
- Where are Bill and Colleen? - Kitchen, getting something to eat.
-比爾和克琳呢？ -他們在廚房弄點吃的。

280
00:16:53,270 --> 00:16:54,800
Can you believe how nice they are?
您能想像他們有多好嗎？

281
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:56,310
We have to leave.
我們必須走！！

282
00:16:57,950 --> 00:17:00,880
Why? What did you do in the bathroom?
為什麼？你在洗手間做了什麼？

283
00:17:01,050 --> 00:17:03,880
I didn't get to the bathroom. I bumped into Owen on the way.
我還沒去洗手間呢。 我在路上碰到了歐文

284
00:17:04,050 --> 00:17:06,780
He didn't know he was adopted. There's a slight chance..
可他還不知道他是被領養的。 有一個小小的機會 

285
00:17:06,950 --> 00:17:08,320
I may have told him.
我告訴了他。

286
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:12,020
Oh, my God, where's my purse? No, I can replace everything in there.
噢，天吶，我的手袋呢？ 不，我們把東西放在這兒。

287
00:17:12,190 --> 00:17:14,630
- Get that binder and let's go! - Hi.
- 拿上活頁冊，走！ -嗨。

288
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:17,330
Some little snacks for everybody.
給大家的一點小吃。

289
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:20,490
You don't have to eat the sour worms. Those are for Owen.
哦，你們不用吃酸蠕蟲， 那是給歐文的。

290
00:17:21,070 --> 00:17:22,560
I'll go get him in a second.
我一會兒去叫他。

291
00:17:22,740 --> 00:17:26,070
By the way, you should know, we haven't told him he's adopted yet.
順便說一句， 你們該知道 我們還沒告訴他他是領養的。

292
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:28,930
But kids are so intuitive.
可孩子們直覺很靈敏。

293
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:31,440
Don't you think, on some level, he already knows?
你不認為某種程度上他已經知道了？

294
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:34,980
- I'm adopted? - See? Intuitive.
- 我是領養的？！ - 看？直覺！

295
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:37,510
What? Where did you hear that?
什麼？你從哪兒聽來的？

296
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:38,840
He told me.
他告訴我的！

297
00:17:40,490 --> 00:17:44,010
And he paid me 50 dollars not to tell.
他還給我50塊錢讓我別說出來。

298
00:17:44,630 --> 00:17:47,250
Which, technically, now you should give back.
那現在你該把錢還給我了！

299
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:52,230
You told him he's adopted?
你告訴他他是領養的？

300
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:55,030
I'm sorry. You should have a sign out there or something.
實在對不起，可你們應該在 那兒或者什麼地方寫明白。

301
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:58,360
Or at least whisper it to people when they come in the door.
或者在人們進門的時候悄悄告訴他們：

302
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:02,030
"Owen doesn't know he's adopted, and he also thinks Santa is real."
「歐文不知道他是領養的， 他也認為聖誕老人是真實存在的。」

303
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:04,010
He isn't?
他不是嗎？！

304
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:07,550
We have to get out of here, baby.
我們必須走了，親愛的！

305
00:18:09,050 --> 00:18:10,410
What is the matter with you?
你怎麼了？

306
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:13,640
All right, look, I know what Chandler did was not the best..
好了, 聽著, 我知道 錢德做的不是最好的..

307
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:17,720
but anyone would assume that a 12-year-old has been told he's adopted.
但是任何人都應該想到 一個12歲的孩子會被告知是被領養的

308
00:18:17,890 --> 00:18:21,450
- Yeah, he's 8. - Wow, he's tall.
- 是的, 他8歲. - 喔, 他長的好高.

309
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,450
What country did you get him from?
你從哪個國家領到他的?

310
00:18:26,430 --> 00:18:29,960
Everyone, I would like to make a toast..
諸位，我要向

311
00:18:30,170 --> 00:18:33,070
to Rachel and Joey.
瑞秋和喬伊敬酒。

312
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:38,100
And to love.
還有愛情。

313
00:18:40,810 --> 00:18:42,180
Ah, love!
啊，愛情。

314
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:46,550
L-O-V-E. Love.
L-O-V-E，愛情。

315
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:48,850
L is for "life."
L是生活。

316
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:51,620
And what is life without love?
沒有愛情哪有生活？

317
00:18:52,630 --> 00:18:55,220
Oh, my God, are we supposed to answer?
噢，我的天吶，我們要回答嗎？

318
00:18:56,730 --> 00:19:00,000
O is for:
O是

319
00:19:00,970 --> 00:19:03,130
"Oh, wow!"
「噢，哇！」

320
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:09,630
The V is for this..
V是

321
00:19:09,810 --> 00:19:13,800
very surprising turn of events..
事情轉變的這麼快

322
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:17,680
which I am still fine with, by the way.
而順便說明，我完全應付得來。

323
00:19:19,550 --> 00:19:21,540
E..
E是

324
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:26,160
is for how..
我發現

325
00:19:26,330 --> 00:19:30,260
extremely normal I find it..
這是多麼的正常。

326
00:19:30,430 --> 00:19:32,560
that you two..
你們倆

327
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:35,070
are together.
走到了一起。

328
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:40,730
And that one day you might get married..
有一天你們會結婚

329
00:19:43,010 --> 00:19:45,910
and have children of your own.
還會有你們自己的孩子。

330
00:19:50,250 --> 00:19:53,520
- Dude, are you okay? - Totally.
-夥計，你還好吧？ -完全沒問題。

331
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,520
Ross, you don't seem okay.
羅斯，你看起來不太好。

332
00:19:56,720 --> 00:20:00,180
I'm sorry, it must be the pressure of entertaining.
對不起，一定是快樂的壓力太大了。

333
00:20:03,730 --> 00:20:07,360
I think everyone would feel better if we had some flan.
我想如果我們吃點果餡餅會感覺好點。

334
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:11,200
Wait, Ross. Ross, I.. I have to take off.
等等，羅斯，我——我要走了。

335
00:20:11,410 --> 00:20:13,270
- No! - I'm sorry.
- 不行！ - 對不起

336
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:16,030
I have an early class in the morning.
我明天早上還有一節很早的課，

337
00:20:16,210 --> 00:20:19,610
But this has been lovely.
不過這已經很好了。

338
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:24,420
Wasn't it? And you thought it would be awkward with Joey.
是嗎？可你認為跟喬伊一起很不自在

339
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:26,990
And that you never really liked Rachel.
而且你從沒真正喜歡過瑞秋。

340
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:32,320
You are on fire! I'll call you in the morning, okay?
你過火了！ 我早上給你打電話，好嗎？

341
00:20:32,490 --> 00:20:34,190
- Okay. - All right.
- 好吧。 - 好

342
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:39,490
God, Rachel, what Ross just said, that's just..
天吶，瑞秋，羅斯剛才說得簡直太……

343
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:42,030
That's okay. Girls tend not to like me.
噢，沒事，女孩們從來都不喜歡我。

344
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,700
Fine.
再見。

345
00:20:46,870 --> 00:20:50,570
Okay. I guess it's just flan for three.
好吧，我想只需要給三個人吃的果餡餅了！

346
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:54,580
Hey, that rhymes.
嘿，嘿，這還挺押韻！

347
00:20:57,120 --> 00:20:59,980
You know what, Ross, I think we're gonna take off too.
知道嗎，羅斯？ 我想我們也該走了。

348
00:21:01,620 --> 00:21:05,080
Of course. God, I'm so stupid.
噢，噢，當然。天吶，我真蠢。

349
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:06,780
You guys are a couple now.
你們現在是一對了。

350
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:09,430
I mean, you probably just want to be alone.
我是說，你們可能想單獨呆著。

351
00:21:09,630 --> 00:21:13,260
- No, it's just getting late.. - It's fine. It's totally fine.
-不，不，我只是說天晚了…… -嘿，嘿，沒事的。真的沒事。

352
00:21:13,430 --> 00:21:16,370
I've got plenty of margaritas. It's all good.
我已經喝了夠多的瑪格麗塔。真得很好。

353
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:25,370
I don't even know what that's for.
我都不知道那是什麼。

354
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:32,480
You know what?
知道嗎？

355
00:21:32,790 --> 00:21:35,810
I think I'm gonna stay here and make sure he's okay.
我想我應該留下保證他沒事。

356
00:21:36,020 --> 00:21:39,150
- That's probably a good idea. - I'll see you in the morning.
-對，這可能是個好主意。 - 對，明天早上見。

357
00:21:39,330 --> 00:21:40,820
Okay.
嗯嗯，好吧。

358
00:21:40,990 --> 00:21:43,120
Yeah, you know, Joey, I..
知道嗎，喬伊

359
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:46,790
I don't think he's ever gonna be okay with this.
我不認為他會接受我們倆在一起。

360
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,200
It doesn't look good, does it?
看起來不太好，是嗎？

361
00:22:04,650 --> 00:22:07,520
I guess I made Tater Tots.
我猜我做了Tater Tots.

362
00:22:10,060 --> 00:22:11,850
Ross, oven mitts!
羅斯, 手套!

363
00:22:26,810 --> 00:22:28,000
Morning.
早上好。

364
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:30,870
- Here you go. - Thanks.
-你醒了。 -謝謝

365
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:34,980
- Did you stay here all night? - Yeah.
-你整個晚上都在這兒? -對。

366
00:22:36,580 --> 00:22:39,580
So you took off my pants and shoes?
你脫了我的褲子和鞋？

367
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:41,340
No. No, no.
不，不，不。

368
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:45,650
You actually did that when you were dancing to the Chicago soundtrack.
實際上是你和著《芝加哥》 的原聲跳舞時自己脫掉的。

369
00:22:47,730 --> 00:22:50,930
Look, Ross..
聽著，羅斯 

370
00:22:51,130 --> 00:22:54,570
about Rachel and I. Listen, you don't have to worry about that..
關於我和瑞秋 聽著，你什麼都不用擔心，知道嗎？

371
00:22:54,740 --> 00:22:57,030
because nothing's gonna happen.
因為什麼都不會發生。

372
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:59,570
What do you mean?
你是什麼意思？

373
00:23:00,070 --> 00:23:01,770
She and I said from the beginning..
好吧，我們從一開始就說

374
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:04,880
we weren't gonna do anything unless you were okay with it.
如果你不接受的話我們什麼都不會做的。

375
00:23:05,050 --> 00:23:06,540
And clearly..
而很明顯……

376
00:23:06,750 --> 00:23:09,440
What are you talking about? I'm fine.
嘿，你在說什麼？我很好！

377
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:13,250
- Are we still doing this? - No.
- 我們可以繼續這樣? - 不可以.

378
00:23:13,950 --> 00:23:17,690
It's okay, Ross. You know, I totally understand.
很好，羅斯，好嗎？ 我完全明白。

379
00:23:17,860 --> 00:23:20,620
Of course you're not fine. You're..
你當然接受不了。你們是……

380
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,960
You're Ross and Rachel.
你們是羅斯和瑞秋

381
00:23:26,030 --> 00:23:28,090
Yeah, except we're not.
除非我們不是。

382
00:23:29,100 --> 00:23:32,400
I mean, we haven't been a couple in, like..
我是說，我們已經有，

383
00:23:34,370 --> 00:23:36,670
six years.
6年沒在一起了。

384
00:23:38,180 --> 00:23:40,870
My God, is that right?
噢，天吶，真的嗎？

385
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:43,110
Has it been that long?
有這麼久了?

386
00:23:44,020 --> 00:23:46,380
That's what I hear, yeah.
我也是這麼聽說的，是的。

387
00:23:47,890 --> 00:23:51,690
This is crazy. I mean, six years..
這太瘋狂了。我是說，6年？

388
00:23:51,860 --> 00:23:55,120
and because of me, you guys aren't gonna be together?
就因為我，你們不能在一起？

389
00:23:56,560 --> 00:23:58,430
Can I ask you something?
我能問你點事嗎？

390
00:23:58,600 --> 00:24:00,070
Really..
說真的 

391
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:03,530
what is this thing with you and Rachel?
你覺得跟瑞秋在一起怎麼樣？

392
00:24:05,540 --> 00:24:09,340
Come on, you know me. You know..
別鬧了，我是說，你瞭解我，你知道……

393
00:24:10,710 --> 00:24:11,770
Joey.
喬伊

394
00:24:18,420 --> 00:24:20,550
I'm crazy about her.
我為她感到瘋狂。

395
00:24:25,930 --> 00:24:28,420
And she feels the same way?
她也這麼想嗎？

396
00:24:30,660 --> 00:24:32,500
I think so.
我想是的。

397
00:24:35,140 --> 00:24:36,730
Well, then..
好吧，那麼 

398
00:24:36,900 --> 00:24:39,100
maybe it's time we all moved on.
可能現在我們都該往前看了。

399
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:42,230
Yeah, but, Ross, I mean, you're not okay with it, so..
對，不過，羅斯 我是說，你並沒有完全接受。

400
00:24:42,410 --> 00:24:45,740
No, but I want to be.
不，我會的。

401
00:24:47,780 --> 00:24:49,370
I will be.
嘿，我會的。

402
00:24:52,450 --> 00:24:55,050
Besides, I'm with Charlie, right?
另外，我還有查莉呢，對吧？

403
00:24:55,220 --> 00:24:57,710
Oh, my God, I'm still with Charlie, aren't I?
噢，天吶，我還跟查莉在一起呢, 是嗎？

404
00:24:57,890 --> 00:25:00,590
- She didn't see the dance, did she? - No, no, no.
-我是說，她沒看見我跳舞吧？ -不，不，不，不

405
00:25:01,660 --> 00:25:05,430
No, that was.. That was just for me.
只有——只有我看見了。

406
00:25:09,040 --> 00:25:10,800
Hey, you..?
你。。

407
00:25:10,970 --> 00:25:12,910
You sure about this?
你說真的？

408
00:25:13,070 --> 00:25:15,770
Yeah, I'm sure.
對，我是說真的。

409
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:19,410
And..
那.. .

410
00:25:20,350 --> 00:25:22,340
we're okay?
我們的關係沒問題嗎？

411
00:25:34,030 --> 00:25:35,620
- Hey, Phoebe. - Hey.
- 嗨，菲比 - 嗨。

412
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:37,820
We just want to give you a heads up.
呃，我們只是想給你提個醒。

413
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:40,330
- Bill and Colleen hate us. - Why?
- 比爾和克琳討厭我們。 - 為什麼？

414
00:25:40,500 --> 00:25:42,930
Owen didn't know he's adopted and Monica told him.
歐文不知道他是領養的， 可莫妮卡告訴了他。

415
00:25:43,100 --> 00:25:44,660
What?
什麼？

416
00:25:44,840 --> 00:25:47,970
- He didn't know? He's 12. - No, he's only 8.
- 他不知道?他12歲了啊. - 不, 他才8歲.

417
00:25:48,140 --> 00:25:50,200
I'll bet he's Russian.
我打賭他是俄羅斯人.

418
00:25:50,380 --> 00:25:52,470
Still, he had to find out sometime.
可是，他總有一天會發現的。

419
00:25:52,650 --> 00:25:56,810
How would you like it if someone told the triplets that you gave birth to them?
對，可如果有人告訴這三胞胎 是你生了他們你會高興嗎？

420
00:26:01,450 --> 00:26:03,720
I'm gonna go tell Emma she was an accident.
我要去告訴愛瑪，說她是個事故的結果。

